        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Sierra On-Line\n- Games: The Lost Mind of Dr. Brain, Hunter Hunted, SAS: Secure Tomorrow\n- Characters: The Mastermind\n- Systems: Jupiter EX engine\n- Concepts: series antagonist mystery\n\nFacts:\n- Sierra On-Line published The Lost Mind of Dr. Brain.\n- Sierra On-Line also published the action video game Hunter Hunted.\n- Hunter Hunted features The Mastermind, an antagonist figure whose mystery is central to the series.\n- SAS: Secure Tomorrow uses the Jupiter EX engine, which is described as similar to, if not identical to, the engine used in Hunter Hunted.",
